## Context: Developer diagnostic for the nearest trader: localized profession, its current table key, the invoking player’s eligible key and current trade-pass state. Technical keys and pass values are supplied verbatim.
lothlorien.message.trade.debug=Depuración de comercio: %s, tabla %s, la tuya %s, permiso %s
## Context: Selecting Trade closes the request form. The player must then click the same elf again to open the native trade screen. This instruction is shown before selecting the button.
lothlorien.message.lore.btn.trade_hint=Luego, vuelve a pulsar al elfo
## Context: Chest armour with leather-level protection. Grants invisibility after sneaking without moving for one second.
item.lothlorien:elven_cloak=Capa élfica
## Context: Elven bow with a faster draw, native bow enchantments and vanilla arrow flight. Galadhrim is a lore proper name.
item.lothlorien:bow=Arco de los Galadhrim
## Context: Off-hand gift rendered at the waist; grants Regeneration I while health is strictly below half maximum.
item.lothlorien:silver_belt=Cinturón de plata
## Context: Off-hand gift that lights nearby air and repels spiders. Galadriel is a lore proper name; phial means a small vial.
item.lothlorien:phial_of_galadriel=Redoma de Galadriel
## Context: Recoverable arrow ammunition fired only by the Bow of the Galadhrim in Survival; same trajectory as a vanilla arrow.
item.lothlorien:galadhrim_arrow=Flecha de los Galadhrim
## Context: Recoverable arrow ammunition fired only by the Bow of the Galadhrim in Survival; same trajectory as a vanilla arrow.
entity.lothlorien:galadhrim_arrow.name=Flecha de los Galadhrim
## Context: Invisible temporary air-space light used by the Phial of Galadriel; hidden from creative inventory and drops nothing.
tile.lothlorien:phial_light.name=Luz de la redoma
## Context: The player tried to draw an ordinary (vanilla) bow while carrying Galadhrim arrows and no normal arrows, so it did not draw. Deliberately vague: say only that an ordinary bow cannot shoot them; do not name the elven bow. Galadhrim is a lore proper name; the arrow name should match its item translation.
lothlorien.message.archery.normal_bow=§7Un arco normal no puede disparar flechas de los Galadhrim.
## Context: A raw, edible cut of meat dropped by an adult swan; can be cooked.
item.lothlorien:swan_meat_raw=Carne de cisne cruda
## Context: The cooked edible cut of swan meat, made in a furnace, smoker or campfire.
item.lothlorien:swan_meat_cooked=Carne de cisne cocinada
## Context: Captured firefly name. Long names continue on additional lore lines; the captured identity, not the anvil bottle title, is restored.
lothlorien.message.firefly.name=Luciérnaga: %s
## Context: Continuation of a captured firefly name on its own tooltip line. Do not add punctuation or change the name.
lothlorien.message.firefly.name_more=%s
## Context: Captured firefly current health in health points, not hearts. Only injured or nondefault-health captures need this lore line.
lothlorien.message.firefly.health=Salud: %s
## Context: An empty reusable leather container for Miruvor. Craft it from leather, fill it in the Miruvor recipe, and recover it after the last sip. Skin means wineskin, not body skin.
item.lothlorien:empty_miruvor_skin=Odre de miruvor vacío
